{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/f71ef1c76a0d59c4ea6cd6c55bca5a5c.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/f71ef1c76a0d59c4ea6cd6c55bca5a5c.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Drink the water of the Mother-Son River, conceive in three days, and give birth in ten.&quot; This is the age-old reproduction rule passed down in the Land of Women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three hundred years ago, a group of deserters strayed into the Land of Women. Trapped by heavy mist, they stayed\u2014marking the first time men set foot in this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps their arrival angered the gods. The Mother-Son River underwent an abnormal change, and a curse quietly befell the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Land of Women\u2019s reproduction rule was shattered, sending history flowing down a completely different path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three hundred years later, Shi Yuan, an office worker from the real world, traveled through a mysterious wardrobe to the Land of Women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shi Yuan met Jian Ling, a mysterious young beauty and owner of a tailor shop. What stories will unfold between these two from vastly different worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist will experience two distinct eras of the Land of Women\u2014the fanatically repressive <strong>All-Female Era</strong> and the bizarrely magical <strong>Curse Era</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did Tang Sanzang go through in the Land of Women?Where did all the men who once came here disappear to?What is the true truth behind the Mother-Son River\u2019s mutation?Is the ever-youthful Companion Minister a human or a monster?What really happened with the pilgrimage to the West to retrieve the scriptures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All secrets about the Land of Women await your exploration.Your choices will determine everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/0803f10af5af3042f0ab3f57e6123c5e.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/0803f10af5af3042f0ab3f57e6123c5e.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/6ace850ba9bf5164d8fffafa1ae19fb5.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shi Yuan: An internet sensation taking the web by storm, who traveled through an old second-hand wardrobe to the Land of Women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/393b8491c0d865b404a421e84d8a6ece.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jian Ling: Owner of a tailor shop, harboring a great secret and holding special feelings for the male protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/31a757262e40cb8a0ba58d2d0ee6b990.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shirakawa Sei: A superstitious straight-A student who is committed to exploring various unsolved mysteries and loves eating dried meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/f92095407933eb238fc4143a3f74b233.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhu Xiuxiu: A shepherd at the Animal Supervision Office, a diehard romantic and a warrior who charges forward fearlessly for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/1c9c3d42a9eace934558804137a0a334.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Wuhou: A defender of the law who is impartial and selfless, yet can be easily bribed with money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/9f5a074cd62aa5603cc9d6b69a9f301d.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aunt Xi: A shrewd and worldly matchmaker, who is particularly interested in others' privacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/c28aa1a203b50d281588a4a62a49177b.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/c28aa1a203b50d281588a4a62a49177b.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/e2c39413a8b6d30a6a2bd7b5a7401d5b.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/e2c39413a8b6d30a6a2bd7b5a7401d5b.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=1062 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the Land of Women, where numerous regions await your exploration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lakeside Street: Lined with restaurants and teahouses, it\u2019s a must-visit to experience the hustle and bustle of daily life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square: Legend has it that confessing your love here will surely earn a response from the one you adore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor Shop: A place where many memories were made, and hidden secrets lie undiscovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slum District: A chaotic and impoverished suburban area with no laws\u2014only the law of the jungle prevails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow Mountain: Braving wind and snow to find the source of the Mother-Son River, and uncover the dark truths hidden in this land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/b76018a2f5e1ff558874359904bafb72.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/b76018a2f5e1ff558874359904bafb72.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Production Team of <i>The Curse of the Land of Women</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995110?t=1774377560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995110?t=1774377560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/786bbd61be335597c5456b7552db58bbcd03c945/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774377560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/786bbd61be335597c5456b7552db58bbcd03c945/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774377560","categorie