ras of the Land of Women\u2014the fanatically repressive <strong>All-Female Era</strong> and the bizarrely magical <strong>Curse Era</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did Tang Sanzang go through in the Land of Women?Where did all the men who once came here disappear to?What is the true truth behind the Mother-Son River\u2019s mutation?Is the ever-youthful Companion Minister a human or a monster?What really happened with the pilgrimage to the West to retrieve the scriptures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All secrets about the Land of Women await your exploration.Your choices will determine everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/0803f10af5af3042f0ab3f57e6123c5e.avif?t=1774377560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras_big/0803f10af5af3042f0ab3f57e6123c5e.webp?t=1774377560 width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/6ace850ba9bf5164d8fffafa1ae19fb5.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shi Yuan: An internet sensation taking the web by storm, who traveled through an old second-hand wardrobe to the Land of Women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995110/extras/393b8491c0d865b404a421e84d8a6ece.avif?t=1774377560\" width=523 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jian Ling: Owner of a tailor shop, harboring a great secret and holding special feelings for the male protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr